<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#dateUncertain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Boolean flag indicating that the associated date or century value is uncertain or provisional. Use in combination with any date property — xsd:date, xsd:gYear, iroko:dateCentury — to distinguish estimated dates from established ones. When true, the associated date should be interpreted as a scholarly estimate subject to revision pending additional evidence. Absence of this property does not imply certainty; treat undeclared dating status as requiring review."@en .
