<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#alternateNames> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Other names, honorifics, or tradition-specific designations for this entity across traditions or lineages. Language-tagged strings. Example: Babalu Aye (Lucumí) / Obaluaye (Candomblé) / Sakpata (Fon)."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#tradition-quimbanda> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Quimbanda"@en .
