<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#tradition-bantu-derived> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Bantu spans multiple geographic regions. This concept is anchored to Central Africa / Kongo-derived Atlantic traditions. See region-east-african and region-southern-african for other Bantu-rooted traditions."@en .
