<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#region-north-african> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Traditions with primary roots in the Maghreb and Mediterranean African zones, including Amazigh/Berber communities, North African Arab traditions, and Coptic Christian communities of Egypt. Also covers ancient Egyptian religious traditions (Kemetic) and their modern revivals."@en .
