<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#RelationshipAssertion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A structured reification node recording a claimed relationship between two entities. Extends iroko:Assertion with relationship-specific slots: relationType, assertionScope, assertionLineage. Inherits governance properties (authorizedBy, recordedInEvent, assertionStatus, accessLevel) from the Assertion superclass."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#contestedStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Boolean indicating whether this entity's attributes, existence, or interpretation are disputed across lineages."@en .
