<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#variationContext> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a TemporalVariation to the context that activates it — a ceremony, liturgical calendar event, fieldwork session, or other conditioning context. Range is intentionally untyped: activating contexts are heterogeneous (RitualProcess, FieldworkEvent, calendar concept, geographic context) and constraining the range now would create fragility. Revisit when TemporalVariation has sufficient data to determine the realistic range."@en .
