<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#region-southern-african> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Traditions with primary roots in the southern African plateau and coastal zones, including Nguni-speaking peoples (Zulu, Xhosa, Swati, Ndebele), Sotho-Tswana communities, Venda, Shona, San/Khoisan hunter-gatherer traditions, and the diverse cultures of southern Africa."@en .
