<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#publicTitleType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates the nature of dc:title when the title does not carry the entity's own name or the name by which the described person or community identifies themselves. A colonial notarial record may carry only an archival call number; a plantation register may assign an imposed name; a museum catalog may apply an institutional label coined decades after the object's creation. This property signals that dc:title is a surrogate identifier and characterizes the source of that surrogate. Planned in v1.3.0; implemented in v1.4.0. Values from iroko:PublicTitleTypeScheme."@en .
