<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#contestsAuthority> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a RitualAuthority, SacredEntity, or Assertion to a ContestedAuthority instance it generates or references. A RitualAuthority contests another when it challenges the legitimacy or historical continuity of that authority's claims. A SacredEntity may have its governing authority contested across lineages. An Assertion may formally contest an authority's basis."@en .
