<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#nativeDateExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The date as expressed in the source document, without conversion to the Gregorian calendar. Preserves original dating systems as recorded: Alexandrian calendar, Era of Diocletian, Era of the Martyrs, Era of the Saracens, Ethiopian year, Hijri calendar, indiction (Constantinopolitan or Egyptian), regnal year, liturgical calendar, or any other indigenous system. Language-tagged string. Do not collapse to a Gregorian xsd:date when the source uses a non-Gregorian system; record the source expression in this field and the Gregorian equivalent separately. Example: '6 Pashons, year 743 of Diocletian'@cop for a Coptic-dated Nubian document."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#nativeDateExpression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-core> .
