<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#oralTransmissionChain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Documented chain of oral transmission for this knowledge. Example: Elder A (Havana) to Elder B (Matanzas) to Informant C (2018)."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#sacredStatus-unknown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SacredStatusScheme> .
