<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#AccessPolicy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A named policy governing disclosure, access, or use of a resource, assertion, or collection. Policies may be conditioned on temporal variation, authority authorization, or community mandate. Used to attach institutional policy nodes to records and assertions. Full governance via iroko:accessLevel (per-property), iroko:EpistemicConstraint (per iroko-epistemic.ttl), and iroko:StewardshipMandate (per iroko-agency.ttl)."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#CustodialRelationshipScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#custodial-lineage-succession> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#AssertionStatusScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#assertion-contested> .
