<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Root class of the Iroko Framework. Represents any resource that can be described, governed, or linked within the framework — whether tradition-specific, archival, documentary, or institutional. iroko:SacredEntity is the primary subclass for tradition-specific sacred knowledge concepts. iroko:ArchivalPerson is the subclass for documented historical persons. Classes defined outside the SacredEntity hierarchy (such as those representing purely archival or infrastructural resources) are direct subclasses of this root."@en .
