<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#region-east-african> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Traditions with primary roots in the Swahili coast, Great Lakes region, and Horn of Africa, including Swahili-speaking coastal communities, Cushitic-speaking peoples (Somali, Oromo, Afar), Great Lakes Bantu communities (Ganda, Nyoro, Haya), and the diverse cultures of the East African interior."@en .
