<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasTemporalVariation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cross-cutting qualifier linking any resource — assertion, policy, property value, access rule, narrative — to a TemporalVariation node. Defined once in Core and referenced across all modules. Do not redefine per-module."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#dateCentury> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-core> .
